error[E0439]: an actor's state exists only inside the actor: start `Counter` with `spawn`
  --> tests/programs/m92/e0439_state.la:6:17
  |
6 |     let state = Counter { count: 0 };
  |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
